# 统一换行：Windows 下文本文件用 CRLF，gradlew 脚本必须 LF 才能在 Linux/macOS 上执行
* text=auto
*.java text eol=crlf
*.kt text eol=crlf
*.kts text eol=crlf
*.xml text eol=crlf
*.md text eol=crlf
*.properties text eol=crlf
*.toml text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary
